---
import "../styles/maps-product.css";
import siteNavigation from "../../../assets/site-nav.js?raw";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>N3XRA Maps | Know Exactly Where Everything Is</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Map meters, valves, hydrants, infrastructure, boundaries, and field locations in one secure N3XRA workspace." />
    <meta name="robots" content="index,follow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://n3xra.com/maps/" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="N3XRA" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="N3XRA Maps | Know Exactly Where Everything Is" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="A simple, field-ready way to map the assets and infrastructure your organization depends on." />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://n3xra.com/maps/" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#132b24" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/assets/n3xra_logo_transparent_small.png" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/site-nav.css?v=4" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/project-cards.css?v=4" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/home-shell.css?v=1" />
    <script is:inline set:html={siteNavigation}></script>
    <script src="/assets/project-cards.js?v=1" defer></script>
  </head>
  <body data-assistant-product="Maps">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="site-topbar home-topbar cards-topbar" data-cards-header>
      <div class="site-topbar-inner"><div class="site-topbar-row">
        <a class="site-brand home-brand" href="/" aria-label="N3XRA home"><img src="/assets/n3xra_logo_transparent_small.png" alt="" /><span>N3XRA</span></a>
        <nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Primary"><a href="/projects/">Projects</a><a href="/services/">Services</a><a href="/support/">Support</a><a href="/#software">Software</a></nav>
        <div class="site-nav-actions"><a class="site-menu-link site-auth-link" href="/account">Dashboard</a><button class="site-menu-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="maps-mobile-menu" aria-label="Open menu" data-site-menu-toggle><span></span><span></span><span></span></button></div>
      </div><nav class="site-mobile-menu" id="maps-mobile-menu" aria-label="Mobile primary" hidden><div class="site-mobile-menu-head"><p class="site-mobile-menu-title">Explore N3XRA</p></div><a class="site-menu-link" href="/projects/">Projects</a><a class="site-menu-link" href="/services/">Services</a><a class="site-menu-link" href="/support/">Support</a><a class="site-menu-link" href="/#software">Software</a></nav></div>
    </header>

    <main id="main-content">
      <section class="cards-hero"><div class="cards-shell cards-hero-grid">
        <div class="cards-hero-copy" data-reveal><p class="cards-kicker">N3XRA Maps</p><h1>Every asset.<br /><em>Right where it belongs.</em></h1><p class="cards-lede">Map meters, valves, hydrants, infrastructure, service areas, and anything else your organization needs to find—on the map and in the field.</p><div class="cards-actions"><a class="cards-button is-primary" href="/support/?product=maps">Request early access</a><a class="cards-button is-secondary" href="#how-it-works">See how it works</a></div><p class="cards-availability"><i></i> N3XRA Maps is entering early access</p></div>
        <div class="cards-hero-demo maps-hero-demo" data-reveal aria-label="N3XRA Maps example"><article class="maps-preview-window"><header><div><small>N3XRA MAPS</small><strong>Water District</strong></div><b><i></i> FIELD READY</b></header><div class="maps-preview-body"><aside><p>MAP LIBRARY</p><div><span>M</span><b>Meters</b><small>1,284</small></div><div><span>V</span><b>Valves</b><small>186</small></div><div><span>◇</span><b>Boundaries</b><small>ON</small></div></aside><div class="maps-demo-map"><i class="maps-road one"></i><i class="maps-road two"></i><i class="maps-road three"></i><button class="maps-pin meter pin-one" type="button">M</button><button class="maps-pin valve pin-two" type="button">V</button><button class="maps-pin meter pin-three" type="button">M</button><span class="maps-you"><i></i>YOU</span><div class="maps-map-toggle"><b>Map</b><span>Satellite</span></div><section class="maps-asset-card"><small>METER</small><strong>Service Meter 0472</strong><span>Account reference · 0472</span><footer><b>8 ft away</b><em>GPS accuracy ±6 ft</em></footer></section></div></div></article></div>
      </div></section>

      <section class="cards-principle" aria-labelledby="principle-title"><div class="cards-shell cards-principle-grid" data-reveal><p>BUILT FOR THE MOMENT YOU NEED IT</p><h2 id="principle-title">Snow can hide the meter.<br /><span>The map still knows where it is.</span></h2><div><p>Open the asset, start field locating, and walk toward its recorded position. N3XRA Maps shows the remaining distance and the accuracy your device is reporting.</p><p>No paper map. No guessing at landmarks. No relying on the one person who remembers where it was installed.</p></div></div></section>

      <section class="cards-steps" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="steps-title"><div class="cards-shell"><header class="cards-section-heading" data-reveal><p class="cards-kicker">How it works</p><h2 id="steps-title">From a blank map to a field-ready system.</h2></header><div class="cards-step-grid"><article data-reveal><span>01</span><div class="step-icon">▧</div><h3>Create your layers</h3><p>Organize the map around meters, valves, hydrants, lines, boundaries, tax lots, and reference maps.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>02</span><div class="step-icon">＋</div><h3>Place each location</h3><p>Drop a pin manually or stand at the asset and record the position from a phone with its reported GPS accuracy.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>03</span><div class="step-icon">⌖</div><h3>Find it again</h3><p>Search the master list, open the mapped item, and use live distance guidance to walk back to it.</p></article></div></div></section>

      <section class="cards-page-builder" aria-labelledby="layers-title"><div class="cards-shell builder-grid"><div class="builder-copy" data-reveal><p class="cards-kicker">Your map, your structure</p><h2 id="layers-title">Give every kind of information its own layer.</h2><p>Turn layers on and off, choose their color and icon, search across mapped items, and keep operational assets separate from reference information.</p><ul><li>Points for meters, valves, hydrants, pumps, and manholes</li><li>Lines for mains, service lines, roads, and routes</li><li>Boundaries for districts, tax lots, parcels, and service areas</li><li>Reference imagery and imported map information</li></ul></div><div class="maps-layer-preview builder-preview" data-reveal><header><small>N3XRA MAPS</small><h3>Map layers</h3><span><i></i> All changes saved</span></header><div><article class="is-featured"><b>M</b><span><small>POINT LAYER</small><strong>Water meters</strong><i>Individual service locations</i></span><em>1,284</em></article><article><b>V</b><span><small>POINT LAYER</small><strong>System valves</strong><i>Isolation and control assets</i></span><em>186</em></article><article><b>⌁</b><span><small>LINE LAYER</small><strong>Water mains</strong><i>Distribution infrastructure</i></span><em>42 MI</em></article><article><b>◇</b><span><small>REFERENCE LAYER</small><strong>Tax and district boundaries</strong><i>Jurisdiction and parcel context</i></span><em>ON</em></article></div></div></div></section>

      <section class="cards-manage" aria-labelledby="field-title"><div class="cards-shell manage-grid"><div class="maps-phone" data-reveal aria-hidden="true"><div class="maps-phone-map"><i class="maps-road one"></i><i class="maps-road two"></i><button class="maps-pin valve" type="button">V</button><span class="maps-you"><i></i>YOU</span></div><section><small>VALVE</small><h3>North isolation valve</h3><strong>3 ft away</strong><span>Current GPS accuracy ±4 ft</span><button type="button">Use my location</button></section></div><div class="manage-copy" data-reveal><p class="cards-kicker">Field ready</p><h2 id="field-title">Designed to leave the office.</h2><p>N3XRA Maps works in the browser on a phone, tablet, or computer. Field crews get the same searchable map and asset details without learning a full desktop GIS system.</p><div class="manage-points"><span><b>Live proximity</b>See how far you are from the selected asset.</span><span><b>Honest accuracy</b>See the accuracy reported by the current device.</span><span><b>Satellite view</b>Switch context when streets and landmarks are not enough.</span><span><b>Ready to grow</b>Connect customer accounts and work orders when those systems are added.</span></div></div></div></section>

      <section class="cards-principle maps-access" aria-labelledby="access-title"><div class="cards-shell cards-principle-grid" data-reveal><p>ACCESS AND OWNERSHIP</p><h2 id="access-title">One organization.<br /><span>The right access for every person.</span></h2><div><p>Account administrators control the workspace and decide who can manage or view map information.</p><p>Every layer and mapped item stays separated by organization with database-level access controls.</p></div></div></section>

      <section class="cards-cta" aria-labelledby="cta-title"><div class="cards-shell" data-reveal><p class="cards-kicker">N3XRA Maps early access</p><h2 id="cta-title">Start with the map.<br />Build the system around it.</h2><p>Paid plans and guided onboarding are being prepared. Request early access or open Maps if it has already been connected to your organization.</p><div class="cards-actions"><a class="cards-button is-primary" href="/support/?product=maps">Request early access</a><a class="cards-button is-secondary" href="/maps/app/">Open Maps</a></div></div></section>
    </main>

    <footer class="cards-footer"><div class="cards-shell"><div><a class="cards-footer-brand" href="/"><img src="/assets/n3xra_logo_transparent_small.png" alt="" /><span>N3XRA</span></a><p>Connected tools for the work you are building.</p></div><nav aria-label="Maps footer"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/services/">Services</a><a href="/support/">Support</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="/terms/">Terms</a></nav></div></footer>
  </body>
</html>
